<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Kalatikailu</para>
  <para style="toc2">KAL</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kalatikailu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Pɔli la bataki lawa Kalatikailu ma</para>
  <para style="imt">Kalatikailu</para>
  <para style="is">Kumakan mɛn ye Kitabu sɛniman ɲin kɔndɔ</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu sɛniman ye sɛbɛni Pɔli le bolo ka a lawa lemɛniya mɔɔilu ma mɛn ye Kalati. Wo bɛɛ sɛbɛni kitabu Talibidenilu la Kɛwaliilu kɔndɔ suran 13 a ni suran 14.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nba, Isa la baara damira waati, lemɛniya mɔɔ siyaman tɛrɛ ye Judiyailu le ri. («Judiyailu» ni «Isirayɛli» wo bɛɛ ye tɔɔ kelen de ri). Judiyailu mɛn lemɛniyara Isa ma ii ka a lɔn ko Mɔɔ Suwandini de, kelalaselailu kumara a la ko rɔ. Ii ma Isa la karan lɔn ikomin dina kura le. Ii la miriya ye, Isa la karanɲa ma, a ye ii la dina le dafala, ikomin Alla ka fɔ ɲa mɛn ma. Ka a masɔrɔn, ii lemɛniyara, kɔni ii ma ii la dina sariya sila si bila, Musa la Tawureta a ni Dawuda la Yaburi. Ii ma si bila. Ii ka lɔnnin mɛn sɔrɔn Isa fɛ, ii ka fanan la wo kan.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kɔndafili si tɛ wo rɔ ka a masɔrɔn Alla la kumakan tɛrɛ ye wala Judiyailu le ma. Kɔni Isa la karandenilu ka a la kumakan nase siya gbɛrɛ mɔɔilu ma waati mɛn na, kɔndafili ka siya gbɛrɛ mɔɔilu mira. Siya gbɛrɛ mɔɔ mɛn lemɛniyara Isa ma, ii ma sɔn Judiyailu la namun tala ka a la ii la lɔnnin kan, ii ka mɛn sɔrɔn Isa la, ka a masɔrɔn Isa la karan ka woilu wasa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ka a masɔrɔn wo fɛ, Judiya lemɛniya mɔɔilu ma kuma kunyɛ siya gbɛrɛ mɔɔilu fɛ, ka a masɔrɔn ɲinilu ma kojiikɛ. Judiya lemɛniya mɔɔilu ka a fɔ ko lemɛniya mɔɔ mɛn ma kojiikɛ ma kisiba bɛrɛ sɔrɔn. Pɔli ka a mɛn tuma mɛn na ko aile ye kuma wo fɔla, a ka ii sɔsɔ ka a fɔ ko ni an di kisi sɔrɔn Isa la saraka sababu la, an mako sa kojii la kosa an di kisi sɔrɔn. A ma a fɔ ko kojiikɛ a ma ɲin. A ka fɔ ko kojiikɛ ti an kisila; an ti se kisila sila si fɛ. Isa kelen pe la saraka le ri se wo kɛla.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sɔsɔli la mɛn ye Judiya lemɛniyamɔɔilu ni siya gbɛrɛ lemɛniyamɔɔilu tɛma wo ri se hankili dila an ma. Sariya doilu ye dina rɔ an di se woilu bonyala, kɔni a ti se an kisila. Namun doilu ye ye an di se bilala namun sila woilu kan. An ti se jatela ikomin a diyagboyani ko an di kisi sɔrɔn. A ka gbɛlɛn dɔɔni ka bɛɛ ɲafɔ, kɔni Alla la kitabu sɛniman wo di se hankili dila an ma ka a ɲayen.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kɛbi Pɔli ka bataki lawa Kalati lemɛniya mɔɔilu ma, a ri se an karanna ka bila lemɛniya a rɔ. Lemɛniya mɔɔilu la sariya fɔlɔ le kaninteya ri. Nii Sɛniman ye lemɛniya mɔɔilu jusu rɔ, wo fanan ye sila yirakala ii la ka lɔ Alla ma. Wo la tɔnɔ ye a la, ni wo tɛ Setana ri bɔ fɛrɛ su bɛɛ la ka ai la lemɛniya tiɲan, ka ai lɔ sila gbɛrɛ ma mɛn ye kojuu sila ri. Alla ye an tanka wo ma. Amina!</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Sɛbɛ ɲin farani nde Pɔli le la, nde mɛn ye talibidenba ri. Mɔɔilu ma n suwandi baara wo kanma. Mɔɔ si ma n kelaya. Ɛɛn, n kɛra talibidenba le ri ka fara Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na, a ni an Fa Alla mɛn ka a lawuli ka a bɔ saya rɔ. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Nde ni an badenma mɛnilu bɛɛ ye n tɔrɔfɛ yan, an ye sɛbɛ ɲin nawala lemɛniya jamailu le ma, mɛnilu ye Kalati jamana rɔ. <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />An Fa Alla a ni Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye hina ni jususuma di ai ma. <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin de ka a jɛrɛ kɛ saraka ri an na kojuuilu kosɔn, sa a ri an bɔ dunuɲa juu ɲin fanka kɔrɔ, baa an Fa Alla sawo tɛrɛ ye wo rɔ. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />A tɔɔ ye gbiliya kadawu. Amina!<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kibaro ɲuma kelen pe le ye ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />N da kabannakoya kojuuya ka a masɔrɔn Alla mɛn ka ai kili ka fara Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ɲumaya la, ai ra ai kɔdon wo la jonna jonna, ka wa kela gbɛrɛ kɔ. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Kɔni kela gbɛrɛ tɛ wo ri de! Mɔɔ doilu le ye ai kɔndafilila ten. Ii ye a fɛ ka Ɲenematɔmɔnin na kibaro ɲuma yɛlɛman. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Kɔni an ka kibaro ɲuma mɛn nase ai ma, ni fen fen ka kela gbɛrɛ lase ai ma, mɛn ni fɔlɔman wo tɛ kelen di, danka ye wo tii kan, hali ni a kɛra andeilu ri, wala sankolo rɔ mɛlɛka do ri. <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />An ka mɛn fɔ ai yɛ kɔrɔman, n di wo fɔ ikɔ ko ai sɔnda kibaro ɲuma mɛn ma, ni mɔɔ mɔɔ ka kela gbɛrɛ lase ai ma, mɛn ni fɔlɔman wo tɛ kelen di, danka ye wo tii kan kadawu!<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />A ye di? N ye a ɲininna ka n jɛrɛ diya mɔɔilu yɛ wa, wala Alla yɛ wa? N ye a ɲininna ka mɔɔilu hɛnɛ wa? Wo kuma tɛ! Ni n tɛrɛ ye a fɛ ka mɔɔilu hɛnɛ fɔlɔ, n tun tɛna kɛla Ɲenematɔmɔnin na baaraden di.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla ka Pɔli bila a la baara la ɲa mɛn ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />N badenmailu, n ye a fɛ ai ye a lɔn ko n ka kibaro ɲuma mɛn nase ai ma, wo ma fara mɔɔ la. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />N ma a sɔrɔn mɔɔ si la. Mɔɔ ma n karan a la fanan. Kɔni Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin jɛrɛ le ka a yiraka n na.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />N tɛrɛ ye taamanna Judiyailu la dina sila kan ɲa mɛn ma fɔlɔfɔlɔ, ai ra wo mɛn. N tɛrɛ ye Alla la lemɛniya jama tɔrɔla fɔɔ ka a dan natamin kojuuya. N tɛrɛ ye a ɲininna ka a ratiɲan fewu. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />N jɛrɛ siya mɔɔilu tɛma, n tɛrɛ ye wala ɲɛfɛ n duuɲɔɔ siyaman di Judiyailu la dina sila kan, baa n benbailu la namunilu tun da gbɛlɛnya n ma kosɛbɛ.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Kɔni ka a tɛrɛn n ma sɔrɔn fɔlɔ, Alla ka n suwandi ka n bila a dan na. A ka n kili ka fara a la ɲumaya la. A diyara a yɛ tuma mɛn na <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />ka a Dencɛ yiraka n na sa n di a la ko fɔ siya gbɛrɛ mɔɔilu yɛ, n ma hankili ɲinin mɔɔ si la. <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />N ma wa Jerusalɛmu ka hankili ɲinin talibidenba fɔlɔilu la. N wara Arabu jamana rɔ i kɔrɔ. Wo kɔ rɔ, n ka n kɔsɛ ka wa Damasi so kɔndɔ.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />San sawa taminni kɔ, n wara Jerusalɛmu, sa n ni Sefasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sefasi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Simɔn Piyɛri, kɔnin.</char></note> ri kuma an ɲɔɔn fɛ. N ka tele tan ni loolu kɛ a tɔrɔfɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Kɔni n ɲa ma la talibidenba tɔilu si kan, fɔɔ Maari Isa dɔɔcɛ Yakuba.<verse eid="GAL 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Nde ye mɛn sɛbɛla ka a di ai ma, wuya tɛ wo ri. N ye wo lasereyala Alla ɲana. <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Wo kɔ rɔ, n wara Siri ni Silisi jamanailu rɔ.<verse eid="GAL 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Kɔni lemɛniya jama mɛnilu sidinin Ɲenematɔmɔnin ma Jude mara rɔ, woilu tun ma nde yen, ii tun ma n lɔn. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Ii ka a mɛn ten de dɔrɔn ko: «Mɛn tɛrɛ ye an tɔrɔla fɔlɔfɔlɔ, wo ye lemɛniya ko lasela mɔɔilu ma sisɛn, a tɛrɛ ye a ɲininna ka lemɛniya ko mɛn tiɲan fɔlɔfɔlɔ.» <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Wo kɛra sababu ri ii ka Alla tando nde la ko kosɔn.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Keladen tɔilu sɔnda Pɔli rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Nba, san tan ni naanin taminni kɔ, nde ni Barinabasi wara Jerusalɛmu ikɔ tuun. N wara Tite fanan di. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />N na wa kun kɛra mɛn di Alla le ka a fɔ n yɛ ko n ye wa. N seni ye, n ye kibaro ɲuma mɛn nasela siya gbɛrɛilu ma, n ka wo yiraka mɔɔbailu la ii la ɲɔɔnyen dɔ ka a ɲafɔ ii yɛ. N ka wo kɛ ka a masɔrɔn n tun tɛ a fɛ n na baara ye kɛ baara fuu ri, n tun ka mɛn kɛ kɔrɔman na, a ni n tɛrɛ ye mɛn kan wo waati la. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Ni wo tɛ, hali n taamaɲɔɔ Tite mɛn ye Kirɛkika ri, ii ma a diyagboya ko a ye faaninta kɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Kuma wo kɛra ka a masɔrɔn wuyafɔla doilu tun ka ii jɛrɛ kɛ ikomin lemɛniya mɔɔilu, ka ii dokon ka don an tɛma. Baa Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ka an kanhɔrɔya ɲa mɛn ma, ii tɛrɛ ye a fɛ ka wo lakɔrɔsi bundu le rɔ. Ii tɛrɛ ye a fɛ ka an kɛ jɔnilu ri ikɔ tuun. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Kɔni an ma sɔn ii rɔ hali waatini, sa kibaro ɲuma ri to ai jusu rɔ, kibaro ɲuma mɛn ye tuɲa ri.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Kɔni mɔɔilu tɛrɛ ye mɛnilu jatela ɲɛmɔɔilu ri, woilu ma fosi la n na kibaro ɲuma kan, n ye mɛn nasela mɔɔilu ma. Ni mɔɔilu ye ii jatela ɲɛmɔɔilu le ri, wo tɛ n ɲana foyi ri, baa Alla tɛ mɔɔ bɔla mɔɔ rɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Kɔni ii jɛrɛ ka a ɲayen ko Alla le ka baara karifa nde la ko n ye kibaro ɲuma lase faanintakɛbaliilu ma, ikomin a ka baara karifa Piyɛri la ɲa mɛn ma ko a ye a lase faanintakɛlailu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Faanintakɛlailu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kojikɛ ko mɛn ye sɛbɛ ɲin dɔ wo kuma ye fɔla Judiyailu la ko le rɔ. </char></note> ma. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Baa Alla ka Piyɛri kɛ faanintakɛlailu la talibidenba ri ɲa mɛn ma, a ka nde fanan kɛ siya gbɛrɛilu la talibidenba ri wo ɲa le ma. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Yakuba ni Sefasi ni Yuhana mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye jatela ɲɛmɔɔbailu ri, woilu jɛrɛ ka a ɲayen ko Alla le ka ɲumaya kɛ n yɛ ka n kelaya. Wo le rɔ, ii ka ii bolo don Barinabasi ni nde bolo, ka a yiraka an na ko an bɛɛ ye baarakɛɲɔɔnilu le ri. An bɛnda a ma ko andeilu ye wa kibaro ɲuma lase siya gbɛrɛilu ma, woilu fanan ye wa wo lase faanintakɛlailu ma. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Ii ka ko kelen ɲinin an fɛ ko an ye an hankili to fantanilu rɔ. N fanan tɛrɛ ye n dajala ka wo kɛ tuma bɛɛ.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔli ka Piyɛri jalaki Antiyɔki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Nba, Sefasi nara Antiyɔki so kɔndɔ tuma mɛn na, n ka a sɔsɔ gbɛ ni gbɛ rɔ, baa a ka ko mɛn kɛ, wo ma bɛn fewu. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Ka a masɔrɔn sani Yakuba la keladenilu ye na, Sefasi ni ye mɔɔilu tɛrɛ ye dɔɔnnin kɛla kelen di, badenma mɛnilu ye siya gbɛrɛilu ri. Kɔni Yakuba la keladenilu nara tuma mɛn na, a ka a jɛrɛ mabɔ siya gbɛrɛ woilu la. A ma sɔn a ni woilu ye dɔɔnnin kɛ kelen di wo kɔ, baa a silanda mɔɔilu yɛ, mɛnilu ka a fɔ ko siya gbɛrɛilu ka kan ka faaninta kɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Badenma ɲɔɔn ma mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye Judiyailu ri, wo tɔilu ka ii bila Piyɛri kɔ a la filanfilanteya rɔ. Wo kɛra sababu ri hali Barinabasi ka a bila ii kɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />N ka a yen tuma mɛn na ko ii tɛ taamanna ka telen kibaro ɲuma sila kan, mɛn ye tuɲa ri, n ka a fɔ Sefasi yɛ ai bɛɛ ɲana ko: «A ye di? Ile mɛn ye Judiya ri, ni ile ka Judiyailu la namunilu bila ka i kɛ ikomin siya gbɛrɛilu, nfen de kosɔn i ye siya gbɛrɛilu diyagboyala ko ii ye Judiyailu la namun latelen?»<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔilu ye kisila lemɛniya le rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />An ye Judiya jɛrɛwolo le ri. An tɛ kojuukɛlailu ri siyailu tɛma. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Kɔni an ka a lɔn ko mɔɔ si ti se kɛla mɔɔ telenni ri ka fara Musa la sariya labatoli la. Ɛɛn, telenbaya ye kɛla ka fara lemɛniya la Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na gbansan. Wo le kosɔn, an fanan lemɛniyani Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ma. Mɔɔ ri kɛ mɔɔ teleni ri ka fara lemɛniya la Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na, Musa la sariya labatoli tɛ. Baa mɔɔ si tɛ kɛla mɔɔ telenni ri ka fara Musa la sariya labato ɲa ma.<verse eid="GAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Nba, ni an ye telenbaya ɲininna gbɛ rɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin naden dɔ, an ye a yirakala wo ɲa kelen de ma ko an ye kojuu kɛla le ri ikomin siya gbɛrɛ mɔɔilu, wo ye a yirakala yɛ ko Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye an sɛɛbɛ donna hakɛ ta ma wo rɔ wa? Wo kuma tɛ! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />N ka sariya mɛn to ye, ni n ka n kɔsɛ wo ma ikɔ, n ye a yirakala ko n ye sariyatiɲanna le ri. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Wo rɔ, sariya labatoli nde jɛrɛ sani sariya rɔ, wo rɔ n ye ɲenemaya rɔ Alla yɛ. Nde ni Ɲenematɔmɔnin gbɔngbɔnda jiri kan kelen di. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Nde sa n niia butun, Ɲenematɔmɔnin de ye a niia n fari rɔ. N ye dunuɲaratɛɛ mɛn kɛla faribanku ɲin dɔ sisɛn, n ye wo kɛla lemɛniya le rɔ Alla Dencɛ yɛ, mɛn ka n kanin ka a jɛrɛ nii di n na ko kosɔn. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />N ti sɔn ka n ban Alla la ɲumaya rɔ. Baa ni mɔɔ ri se kɛla mɔɔ telenni ri ka fara sariya labatoli la, Ɲenematɔmɔnin faani le wo rɔ gbansan!<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Alla ye mɔɔ jatela mɔɔ telenni ri ka fara lemɛniya le la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Ai Kalatikailu, ai ye kɔmɔɔilu le ri! Yon de ka ai lafili? Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin faa mɛn kɛnin gbɔngbɔn jiri kan, nde ka wo yiraka ai la ka a gbɛ. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />N ye a fɛ ka ai maɲininka ɲininkali kelen ma: Ai ka Nii Sɛniman sɔrɔn di? Ai ka wo sɔrɔn ka a masɔrɔn sariya labatoli le ma wa, wala ka a masɔrɔn lemɛniyala kibaro ɲuma le rɔ, ai ka mɛn namɛn? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Nfenna ai kɛra kɔmɔɔilu ri wo rɔ? Ai nɔ sila mɛn taama damirala Nii Sɛniman na sebaya rɔ. A ye di? Ai ye a fɛ ka a laban a jɛrɛ la sebaya le rɔ wa? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Ai ka ko siyaman muɲun ai ma. Wo kɛra ko fuu le ri wa? Ni wo kɛra fuu! <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Alla mɛn ye Nii Sɛniman dila ai ma ka kabannakoilu kɛ ai tɛma, a ye wo kɛla ka a masɔrɔn ai ye Musa la sariya labatola wa, wala ka a masɔrɔn ai lemɛniya kibaro ɲuma ma, ai ka mɛn namɛn wa?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Nba, Iburahima don? «Iburahima lara Alla la ɲa mɛn ma; wo le kosɔn, Alla ka a jate mɔɔ telenni ri,» <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />wo rɔ ai ye a lɔn ko mɛn wa lemɛniya wo le Iburahima den di. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />A sɛbɛni Alla la kitabu kɔndɔ fɔlɔfɔlɔ ko Alla ri siya tɔilu kɛla a jɛrɛ ɲakɔrɔ mɔɔ telenniilu ri ka fara ii la lemɛniya le la. Wo le kosɔn, a sɛbɛni ko a ka kibaro ɲuma lase Iburahima ma fɔlɔ ko: «Siyailu bɛɛ ri Alla la ɲumaya sɔrɔn ile le fɛ.» <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Awa, mɔɔ mɔɔ wa lemɛniya Alla ma ikomin Iburahima lara Alla la ɲa mɛn ma, wo bɛɛ ri Alla la ɲumaya sɔrɔn.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu ra ii la lemɛniya la sariya labatoli kan, woilu bɛɛ dankani. Baa a sɛbɛni Alla la kitabu kɔndɔ ko: «Mɔɔ mɛnilu tɛ Alla la sariya sɛbɛnilu bɛɛ labatola, wo tiilu bɛɛ dankanin de.» <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />A gbɛni le ko mɔɔ si tɛna kɛla Alla ɲakɔrɔ mɔɔ telenni ri ka fara sariya labatoli la. Baa: «Mɔɔ telennin di a la dunuɲaratɛɛ kɛ landaɲa rɔ.» <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Kɔni ka Alla la sariya labato, a ni ka lemɛniya Alla ma, woilu tɛ kelen di muumɛ. Baa: «Mɔɔ mɛn ka sariyailu bɛɛ labato, wo ri kɛ ii la dunuɲa latɛɛ kun di.»<verse eid="GAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Ɲenematɔmɔnin ka an kunka danka le la, mɛn ye mɔɔilu kan sariya kosɔn. Danka wo ye a kan an na nɔ rɔ. Baa a sɛbɛni ko: «Mɔɔ mɔɔ dunni jiri la, wo tii dankani.» <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ka wo kɛ sa Iburahima la duwawu ri se siya gbɛrɛilu ma, a ni an bɛɛ ri Nii Sɛniman sɔrɔn landaɲa rɔ.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa la sariya ni Alla la teriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />N badenmailu, n di misali di ka a bɛn an na namunilu ma. Ni mɔɔ do ka teriya sidi ka ban, mɔɔ si kana teriya wo lasa, mɔɔ si kana do la teriya wo kan. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Awa, Alla ka teriya sidi Iburahima ni a bɔnsɔn ma. A ma sɛbɛ ko «a bɔnsɔnilu» ikomin bɔnsɔn siyaman de ko. Ɛɛn, a sɛbɛni ko «i bɔnsɔn.» Wo kɔrɔ le ko «i bɔnsɔn» kelen de ri, mɛn ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin di. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />N ye a fɛ ka mɛn fɔ, wo le ɲin di: Sariya mɛn nara san kɛmɛ naanin ni san bisawa (430) Alla la teriya kɔma, wo ti se Alla la teriya banna. Kɔni sariya wo ti se ka Alla la teriya lasa ka Alla la lahidi bɔ a nɔ rɔ. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Baa ni cɛta ye sɔrɔnna sariya labatoli le rɔ, a tɛ sɔrɔnna lahidi rɔ butun. Kɔni Alla ka wo di Iburahima ma lahidi wo sababu le rɔ.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sariya siikun ye mɛn di</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Nba, sariya kun ye mun di? A siira, sa an di sariya tiɲan koilu lɔn haan lahidi den wa sɔrɔn waati mɛn, lahidi mɛn sidinin. Mɛlɛkailu ka sariya wo di ka fara kumalataaminna le la <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Ni kumalataaminna ye ye, mɔɔ kelenna ko tɛ wo ri. Kɔni lahidi la ko rɔ, Alla kelen pe le wo ri.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />A ye di wo rɔ? Musa la sariya ye Alla la lahidilu sɔsɔla le wa? Wo kuma tɛ! Ni sariya dira mɔɔilu ma, mɛn tun di se ɲenemaya dila ii ma, mɔɔilu tun di jate mɔɔ telennilu ri ka fara sariya wo la. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Kɔni sɛbɛli kuma wo le nɔ an bilala kaso la an julumun dɔ, sa Alla ri a la lahidi dafa lemɛniya mɔɔilu yɛ ka fara ii la lemɛniya la Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Sani lemɛniya waati ye se, sariya tɛrɛ ye an kɔnɔgbɛnna ka an kɛ ikomin kasodenilu. An tora ten haan ka lemɛniya makɔnɔ, mɛn natɔ bɔla gbɛ rɔ. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Wo rɔ, sariya wo kɛra ikomin an na kɔrɔsiba fɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin na waati, sa an di jate mɔɔ telenniilu ri ka fara lemɛniya la. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Lemɛniya nala sisɛn, an tɛ kɔrɔsiba wo bolo butun.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Baa ai bɛɛ ra kɛ Alla denilu ri ka fara lemɛniya la, lemɛniya mɛn ye ai badila Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ma. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Ai mɛn sunda ji rɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin tɔɔ rɔ, ai badini Ɲenematɔmɔnin ma.<verse eid="GAL 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Wo le kosɔn, faranfaasi tɛ Judiyailu ni siya gbɛrɛilu tɛma butun, wala jɔnilu ni hɔrɔnilu tɛma, wala cɛɛ ni muso tɛma. Baa ai bɛɛ ka kan Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ma. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Ni ai ye Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ta le ri, ai fanan ye Iburahima bɔnsɔnilu le ri. Cɛta la le ile ri ikomin lahidi mɛn taani.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Nba, n ye a fɛ ka mɛn fɔ, wo le ɲin di: den de ye a fa cɛtala ri. A fa la fen bɛɛ ri kɛ a ta ri. Hali wo, a denninya waati, a ni jɔn bɛɛ ka kan. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Ka a to denninya rɔ, a tɛrɛ ye a denmamiralailu ni a denmakololailu la fanka le kɔrɔ fɔɔ ka wa se a fa la waati latɛɛni ma. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Andeilu fanan tɛrɛ ten de. An tɛrɛ ye denninya rɔ tuma mɛn na, an tɛrɛ ye dunuɲa koilu fanka le kɔrɔ, ka kɛ woilu la jɔnilu ri. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Kɔni Alla la waati latɛɛni sera tuma mɛn na, a ka a dencɛ lana. Muso le ka a sɔrɔn. A sɔrɔnda Musa la sariya kɔrɔ, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />sa a ri mɔɔilu kunka, mɛnilu ye sariya kɔrɔ, kosa an di kɛ a denilu ri.<verse eid="GAL 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Ɔɔn, ikomin ai ye Alla denilu ri, a ka a Dencɛ Nii lana an ma. Nii Sɛniman wo ye a kɛla, an ye Alla kilila ko: «an Baba, an Fa!» <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Wo le rɔ, i tɛ jɔn di butun, i ye Alla den de ri sisɛn. Ikomin i ye Alla den di, a ra mɛn dabɛn a denilu bɛɛ yɛ, i fanan di wo sɔrɔn ale baraka rɔ.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔli haminni Kalatikailu la ko rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Fɔlɔfɔlɔ, ka a tɛrɛn ai tun ma Alla lɔn fɔlɔ, ai tɛrɛ ye jenailu la jɔnya le rɔ. Woilu tun tɛ batofen sebɛɛilu ri. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Kɔni sisɛn ai ka Alla lɔn; tuɲa le Alla ka ai lɔn. Ai ye a fɛ ka wa dunuɲa ko barakatanilu le kɔ ikɔ wo rɔ wa, wo mɛnilu tɛ foyi ɲala ai ma? Ai ye a fɛ ka kɛ woilu la jɔnilu ri kokura wa? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Ai ye lon doilu jatela lon bailu ri ka woilu bonya, a ni karo doilu a ni waati doilu a ni san doilu. <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Aa! N da hamin ai la ko la, ko n ka baara mɛn kɛ ka ai madɛmɛn, wo bɛɛ ri kɛ baara fuu ri.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />N badenmailu, n ye ai madiyala ko ai ye ai jɛrɛ kɛ ikomin nde ye ɲa mɛn ma, baa n ka n jɛrɛ kɛ ikomin ai ye ɲa mɛn ma. Ai ma kojuu si kɛ n na. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Ai ka a lɔn ko jankarɔ le ka a kɛ n sera ai wara ka kibaro ɲuma lase ai ma fɔlɔfɔlɔ. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />N na jankarɔ ka ai tɔrɔ kosɛbɛ, kɔni ai ma n dɔɔya, ai ma ai kɔdon n na. Ai ka n mira koɲuma, ikomin ai tun di Alla la mɛlɛka wala Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin jɛrɛ mirala ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Ai sɛwanin tɛrɛ kosɛbɛ. Sɛwa wo wanin min? N ye sereya ri ko ni a se tɛrɛ ai yɛ wo lon, ai tun di ai ɲaden bɔ ka a di n ma. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Ai ye n jatela ai juu ri baa n ka tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ wa?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Mɔɔ woilu ye ii rajala kosɛbɛ ai la ko rɔ, kɔni ii tɛ wo kɛla ko ɲuma la. Baa ii ye a fɛ le ka n ni ai fara ka an bɔ an ɲɔɔn na, sa ai ri ai raja ka wa ii kɔ. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Ni ai ka ai raja koɲuma kɛla tuma bɛɛ, wo ka ɲin. Ai kana wo kɛ n ɲana gbansan. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />N denilu, n ye tɔrɔla ai la ko rɔ kokura ikomin muso mɛn ye tin ma. N di tɔrɔ ten haan Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye don ai rɔ tuma mɛn na. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />A lɔɔ ye n na sisɛn ka kɛ ai tɛma, sa n di se kumala ai yɛ ɲa gbɛrɛ ma. Baa n da kɔndafili ai la ko rɔ.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saran ni Hajara la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Nba, ai mɛnilu ye a fɛ ka tɔ Musa la sariya kɔrɔ, ai ye n jabi: Sariya wo ka mɛn fɔ, ai ma wo lɔn wa? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Nba a sɛbɛni ko Iburahima ka dencɛ fila sɔrɔn. Jɔnmuso ka kelen sɔrɔn a yɛ, hɔrɔnmuso ka a tɔ kelen sɔrɔn a yɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Jɔnmuso den sɔrɔnda ikomin cɛɛ ni muso ye den sɔrɔnna ɲa mɛn ma tuma bɛɛ. Kɔni hɔrɔnmuso den sɔrɔnda ka a kɛ lahidi den de ri, Alla tun ka lahidi mɛn ta Iburahima yɛ.<verse eid="GAL 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Misaliya gbɛrɛ fanan ye tariku wo rɔ. Nba, muso fila woilu ye teriya su fila yirakala. Teriya mɛn sidira Sinayi koyinkɛ kan, Hajara ye wo le yirakala. Ale ye den mɛnilu sɔrɔnna, woilu ye jɔnilu le ri. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Hajara le ye Sinayi koyinkɛ misali ri, mɛn ye Arabu jamana rɔ. Hajara le ye Jerusalɛmu misali fanan di, mɛn ye ye bi. Baa Jerusalɛmu wo ni a la mɔɔilu ye jɔnya le rɔ. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Kɔni Alla la Jerusalɛmu mɛn ye sanma, wo hɔrɔyani le. Ale le ikomin an na. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Baa a sɛbɛni Alla la kitabu kɔndɔ ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">«Ile muso densɔrɔnbali, ile mɛn tɛ den sɔrɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">i ye sɛwa ka ɲaalen kosɛbɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">Ɔɔn, ile mɛn ma tin tɔrɔ lɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">i ye i sɛwakan ba labɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">Baa muso mɛn da bila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">wo denilu ri siyaya ka tamin muso cɛtii ta kan.»<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Wo le rɔ, n badenmailu, ai ye lahidi denilu le ri, ikomin Isiyaka. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Jɔnmuso ka den sɔrɔn ikomin cɛɛ ni muso ye den sɔrɔnna ɲa mɛn ma tuma bɛɛ. Hɔrɔnmuso ka den sɔrɔn ikomin cɛɛ ni muso ye den sɔrɔnna ɲa mɛn ma, kɔni den farara Nii Sɛniman na. Nba, wo tuma jɔnmuso den ka hɔrɔnmuso den wo tɔrɔ. Hali bi a ye ten de. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Kɔni a sɛbɛni Alla la kitabu kɔndɔ di? A sɛbɛni ko: «Jɔnmuso ni a dencɛ gbɛn, baa hɔrɔnmuso dencɛ ri a fa cɛta. Jɔnmuso dencɛ sen tɛ a rɔ muumɛ.» <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Wo le kosɔn, n badenmailu, an tɛ jɔnmuso denilu ri; an ye hɔrɔnmuso denilu le ri.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Ɲenematɔmɔnin ka an hɔrɔya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Ɲenematɔmɔnin ka an hɔrɔya, sa an di kɛ mɔɔ hɔrɔyani jɛrɛ jɛrɛ ri. Wo le rɔ, ai ye ai rajala. Ai kana sɔn mɔɔilu ye ai bila sariya jɔnya rɔ kokura.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Ai ye ai tolo malɔ! Nde Pɔli ka a fɔ ko ni ai sɔnda mɔɔilu ye ai la faaninta kɛ, Ɲenematɔmɔnin ka baara mɛn kɛ ai yɛ, wo tɛ foyi ɲa ai ma. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />N ye a fɔla ikɔ tuun ko mɔɔ mɔɔ wa sɔn mɔɔilu ye a la faaninta kɛ ten, fɔɔ wo tii ye Musa la sariya bɛɛ labato; diyagboya le wo ri. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Ai mɛnilu ye a ɲininna ka kɛ mɔɔ telen di ka fara Musa la sariya la, ai ra ai jɛrɛ fara Ɲenematɔmɔnin na. Ai ra ai kɔdon Alla la ɲumaya la.<verse eid="GAL 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Kɔni andeilu, an jii ye a rɔ ko Alla ri an jate mɔɔ telenni ri. Nii Sɛniman ye an dɛmɛnna ka wo le makɔnɔ ka fara an na lemɛniya la. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Baa ni mɔɔ sidinin Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ma, faaninta kɛ tɛ foyi ri butun, faanintakɛbaliya fanan tɛ foyi ri butun. Mɛn ye ko ba ri, wo ye lemɛniya le ri, lemɛniya mɛn ye mɔɔ lɔla kɛwaliilu kɛla kaninteya kosɔn.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Ai tɛrɛ ye ai borila koɲuma! Yon ka ai la sila tɛɛ, ka ai mabali tuɲa labatola? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Mabalili wo ma bɔ ale rɔ, mɛn ka ai kili. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />«Lɛbɛn fitinin di buru siyaman nawuli ka a funun.» <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Nba, n lani ai la ko ai la miriya a ni n na miriya ri kanya, baa an bɛɛ sidinin Maari ma. Kɔni mɔɔ mɛn ye ai hankili ɲaaminna, wo tii ri a sara sɔrɔn, a kɛra mɔɔ su su ri.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />N badenmailu, ni n ye mɔɔilu kawandila fɔlɔ ko ii ye faaninta kɛ, nfenna mɔɔilu ye n tɔrɔla? Ni n ye mɔɔilu kawandila ten, Ɲenematɔmɔnin faa ko gbɔngbɔn jiri kan, wo tun tɛna gbala mɔɔ si la. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu ye ai lamaala, woilu ka kan ka ii jɛrɛ cɛɛya diya tɛɛ!<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lemɛniya mɔɔilu ka kan ka taama ɲa mɛn ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />N badenmailu, Alla ka ai kili sa ai ri kɛ mɔɔ hɔrɔyaninilu ri. Kɔni ai kana hɔrɔya ko wo kɛ sababu ri ka ai faribanku diyanan koilu kɛ. Ɛɛn! Ai ye ai ɲɔɔn dɛmɛn, kaninteya kosɔn. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Baa Alla la sariya bɛɛ ye sɔrɔnna ɲin kuma kelen de kɔndɔ ko: «I ye i mɔɔɲɔɔ kanin ikomin i jɛrɛ.» <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Ni ai ka ai ɲɔɔn cin ka ai ɲɔɔn rafarafara, ai ri ai jɛrɛ tiɲan.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />N ye a fɔla ai yɛ ko ai ye taama ka a bɛn Nii Sɛniman na sila ma, wo rɔ nata juu mɛnilu ye ai fari rɔ, woilu ti nala ai lɔla kojuu kɛla habadan. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Baa nata juu mɛnilu ye ai fari rɔ, woilu ye Nii Sɛniman sɔsɔla. Nii Sɛniman fanan ye woilu sɔsɔla. Ii ye ii ɲɔɔn kɛlɛla. Wo rɔ, ai ye a fɛ ka mɛn kɛ, ai ti se wo kɛla. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Kɔni ni ai ye taamanna ka a bɛn Nii Sɛniman na sila ma, ai tɛ Musa la sariya fanka kɔrɔ butun.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Faribanku ye baarada mɛn kɛla, wo le ɲin di, bɛɛ ka a lɔn: jatɔya ni ko nɔɔni kɛ ni malobaliya koilu <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />ni joo sɔli ni suwaya ni lagboyaɲɛ ni sɔsɔli ni kɛlɛya ni jusumaya ni natabaya ni bɛnbaliya ni kanintema le fara ii ɲɔɔnna, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />ni nata ni dɔlɔmin ni manamana ko dan natamin mɔɔilu, a ni wo ɲɔɔn gbɛrɛ. N ye ai lalɔnninna sisɛn ikomin n ka ai lalɔnnin ɲa mɛn fɔlɔ ko mɔɔ mɛnilu ye ko su woilu kɛla, woilu ti nala niiyɔrɔ sɔrɔnna Alla la mansaya rɔ.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Kɔni Nii Sɛniman ye a den mɛn kɛla mɔɔ jusu kɔndɔ, wo le ɲin di: kaninteya ni sɛwa ni jususuma ni muɲunnin ni mɔɔ dɛmɛnnin ni ɲumaya ni lemɛniya <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />ni sabari a ni senjɛrɛla. Sariya si tɛ ko su woilu kanma. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu ye Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ta ri, ii ra ii sawonan koilu ni ii nata juu bailu bɛɛ gbɔngbɔn jiri kan. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Ni an da ɲenemaya kura sɔrɔn Nii Sɛniman dɔ, an ka kan ka an taama ka a bɛn a la sila ma. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />An kana jɛrɛdabaya kɛ, an kana sɔsɔli lawuli an ni an ɲɔɔn tɛma, an kana an ɲɔɔn kɛlɛya.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Lemɛniya mɔɔilu ka kan ka i ɲɔɔn dɛmɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />N badenmailu, ni ai ka mɔɔ do yen kojuu kɛla, ai mɛnilu ye taamanna ka bɛn Nii Sɛniman sawo ma, ai ye wo tii lali jususuma rɔ, ka a dɛmɛn a kɔsɛla sila ɲuma kan. Kɔni i ye i janto i jɛrɛ rɔ, sa i fanan kana manɛɛn ka kojuu wo ɲɔɔn kɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Ai ye i ɲɔɔn dɛmɛn ai la doninilu tala sa ai ri Ɲenematɔmɔnin na sariya labato a ɲa ma. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Ni mɔɔ mɛn ye a mirila ko ale ye mɔɔ ba le ri, ka a tɛrɛn a tɛ foyi ri, wo tii ye a jɛrɛ le lafilila. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Mɔɔ kelen kelenna bɛɛ ye a jɛrɛ la kɛwaliilu fɛsɛfɛsɛ a ni ka a jɛrɛ bonya. A mako tɛ a la ka a la kɛwaliilu la mɔɔ gbɛrɛ ta ma. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Baa bɛɛ ka kan ka a jɛrɛ la kunko ta.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Mɛn da Alla la kumakan sɔrɔn ka a karan, wo tii ka kan ka a la karanmɔɔ sɔ a bolofen ɲumailu rɔ.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Ai kana ai jɛrɛ lafili. Mɔɔ ti se mɔnɛdona Alla rɔ wala ka a mayɛlɛ. Baa mɔɔilu wa si su su foyi sɛnɛ rɔ, ii ri suman su wo sɔrɔn. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Ɔɔn, mɔɔ mɛn wa sɔn a jɛrɛ faribanku nata juuilu ma ka kojuu kɛ, wo tii ri saya sɔrɔn. Kɔni mɔɔ mɛn wa sɔn Nii Sɛniman diyanan koilu ma ka koɲuma kɛ, wo tii ri ɲenemaya banbali sɔrɔn. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />An kana kori koɲuma kɛ rɔ, baa ni an ma jiitɛɛ ka a boloka, an di a tɔnɔ sɔrɔn a waati la. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Wo le kosɔn, an wa fɛrɛ sɔrɔn tuma mɛn na, an ka kan ka koɲuma kɛ mɔɔilu bɛɛ yɛ, ka tɛrɛ tɛ an badenma lemɛniya mɔɔilu ma.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuma laban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Nba, ai ye sɛbɛden kunba ɲinilu ragbɛ. Nde ye woilu sɛbɛla n jɛrɛ bolo le la ka a lawa ai ma. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu ye a fɛ ka ai diyagboya ko ai ye faaninta kɛ, ii bɛɛ ye a ɲininna ka diya mɔɔilu yɛ tuun, baa ii tɛ a fɛ mɔɔilu ye ii tɔrɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin faa gbɔngbɔn jiri kan wo kosɔn. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Baa mɔɔ mɛnilu ye faaninta kɛla, woilu jɛrɛ tɛ Musa la sariya labatola. Kɔni ii ye a fɛ ai ye faaninta kɛ sa ii ri se ii jɛrɛbonyala ko ii ka a kɛ faaninta kɛ nɔ ra kɛ ai fari ma. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Nde kɔni, n tɛna n jɛrɛbonyala ko si ma, fo an na Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin faa ko gbɔngbɔn jiri kan. A la saya kosɔn gbɔngbɔn jiri wo kan, dunuɲa koilu ye n ɲana ikomin fen mɛnilu faani. N fanan ye dunuɲa ɲana ikomin fen mɛn faani. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Faaninta kɛ tɛ foyi ri. Faanintakɛbaliya fanan tɛ foyi ri, fɔɔ a kɛ danfen kura ri.<verse eid="GAL 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Mɛnilu ye sila wo taamanna a ni Isirayɛli mɔɔilu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">A la Isirayɛli mɔɔilu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">wo kɔrɔ ye le mɔɔ mɛnilu lemɛniyani Maari Isa ma ko ale le ye an kisiba ri.</char></note> fanan, Alla ye jususuma di wo bɛɛ ma, ka kininkinin ii la.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Nba, sisɛn mɔɔ si kana n tɔrɔ butun, baa tɔrɔya nɔ mɛnilu ye n fari ma, n ka woilu sɔrɔn Isa le kosɔn.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />N badenmailu, an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ɲumaya ye to ai fɛ. Amina.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>